					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#822">Installing Guild Structure</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I have talked to Jae and he does not object to the draft plans that have been talked about in the message board.  Therefore, its time to put these plans into place.  There are two votes that will be ongoing until April 25.  You have until then to cast your votes for Trade Board and the Triumvirate.<br />
Jae will be the proxy treasurer for the time being.  If there is no objection, he will remain the treasurer.<br />
I will be writing the charter over the next few days.  I hope to have the draft written over the next few days.<br />
<br />
Thank You and Safe Travels
						</td>
					</tr>
