					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#758">Thanks</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Thanks to everyone who have currently registered for the guild, I have accepted you all. So thanks to Kveldwulf, Aerwinar, and Lansh. Having this site will help manage our guild better and easier, and it helps to know that everyone is at least registered for the guild and on the roster. Other guild officers can also create news headings and events, so feel free to any time. If you schedule an event just let me know about it, I'm always willing to help, or if anyone has a suggestion for an event or raid please send me a tell or if your an officer feel free to post it here, I'll welcome all ideas.<br />
<br />
Safe Hunting.
						</td>
					</tr>
