					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#757">First Event</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Hello everyone, I will be holding the first guild event at &quot;the arena&quot; zone off of Lake Rathe this friday February 14th. I hope everyone or most of the guild can attend. I will have many prizes to be won and much fun to be had. It will begin around 5 p.m. EST. If you have any questions please tell me in game. If you think you will have trouble getting there, I will be running a party there myself, and I'm pretty sure Kveldwolf will run one for me, if anyone else knows how to get there please tell me, it will be a great help to have another helping lead everyone. <br />
<br />
Safe Hunting.
						</td>
					</tr>
